# Local reference screenshots (not part of the app)
screenshots/

# Wrangler's local build and dev-server state. Created by `wrangler dev` and
# `wrangler deploy --dry-run`; the deployed Worker is built from src/ on
# Cloudflare's side, so none of this belongs in the repo.
.wrangler/

# Local dev server config for the Claude Code browser preview (not shared).
.claude/launch.json

# Raw Lighthouse reports behind baseline/lighthouse-before.json (~18 MB across
# 33 files). The committed summary carries every number that is actually cited —
# medians, per-run spreads, and the method — so the raw reports are evidence to
# keep locally, not repository content. Regenerate them rather than committing:
# they are a point-in-time capture of a deployed site, not a build artifact.
baseline/raw/
